### BM4A request collection (IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client).
### Set @token from: scripts/dev-token.sh alice   - and @org from the "create organization" response.

@api = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@token = paste-access-token-here
@org = paste-organization-id-here
@record = paste-record-id-here

### Who am I
GET {{api}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update profile
PATCH {{api}}/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"locale": "en-IN", "timeZone": "Asia/Kolkata", "preferences": {"theme": "dark"}}

### Create organization
POST {{api}}/orgs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Acme"}

### My organizations
GET {{api}}/orgs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add a member (userId from GET /me of that user)
POST {{api}}/orgs/{{org}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"userId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "role": "MEMBER"}

### Define the ExampleAsset module (every field type)
POST {{api}}/orgs/{{org}}/modules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ../examples/example-asset-module.json

### Add a field later
POST {{api}}/orgs/{{org}}/modules/example_asset/fields
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"apiKey": "location", "label": "Location", "type": "TEXT", "filterable": true}

### Layout
PUT {{api}}/orgs/{{org}}/modules/example_asset/layout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-Match: "2"
Content-Type: application/json

{"sections": [{"key": "general", "label": "General", "columns": 2, "fields": ["name", "serial", "quantity"]},
              {"key": "commercial", "label": "Commercial", "tab": "Finance", "fields": ["price", "purchased_on"]}]}

### Create a record
POST {{api}}/orgs/{{org}}/modules/example_asset/records
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"data": {"name": "Laptop", "serial": "LAP-001", "price": {"amount": "85000", "currency": "INR"}, "tags": ["it"]}}

### Read a record
GET {{api}}/orgs/{{org}}/modules/example_asset/records/{{record}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Partial update (JSON Merge Patch)
PATCH {{api}}/orgs/{{org}}/modules/example_asset/records/{{record}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-Match: "1"
Content-Type: application/merge-patch+json

{"data": {"quantity": 4, "notes": null}}

### List with filter, sort, search and paging
GET {{api}}/orgs/{{org}}/modules/example_asset/records?filter[quantity][gte]=2&sort=-price&q=lap&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Soft delete
DELETE {{api}}/orgs/{{org}}/modules/example_asset/records/{{record}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-Match: "2"

### Restore
POST {{api}}/orgs/{{org}}/modules/example_asset/records/{{record}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-Match: "3"

### History
GET {{api}}/orgs/{{org}}/modules/example_asset/records/{{record}}/versions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Relationship between two modules
POST {{api}}/orgs/{{org}}/relationships
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"apiKey": "asset_components", "label": "Components", "inverseLabel": "Part of",
 "sourceModule": "example_asset", "targetModule": "example_asset", "cardinality": "ONE_TO_MANY", "onDelete": "DETACH"}

### Audit trail
GET {{api}}/orgs/{{org}}/audit-events?size=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
